<title>HONG KONG: SQUASH-RESULT OF THE HONG KONG OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-RESULT OF THE HONG KONG OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the Hong</p>
<p>Kong Open on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) 15-10</p>
<p>15-10 15-5.</p>
